WEBVTT

00:01:01.798 --> 00:01:03.278
But we adapted.

00:01:03.318 --> 00:01:04.938
We started to accept,

00:01:04.958 --> 00:01:08.158
and slowly we shifted more
and more of what we did

00:01:08.198 --> 00:01:10.878
from in-person to online.

00:01:10.898 --> 00:01:13.098
We started to rely
on the power of the internet

00:01:13.138 --> 00:01:15.178
to order our groceries online,

00:01:15.198 --> 00:01:16.898
to order our meals,

00:01:16.918 --> 00:01:18.978
to speak to our friends

00:01:18.998 --> 00:01:21.898
or even to learn how to take care
of that plant, finally.

00:01:22.318 --> 00:01:24.378
We used the internet to pray.

00:01:24.418 --> 00:01:28.698
We used it to exercise, to meditate,
to speak to our therapists.

00:01:28.738 --> 00:01:31.538
Organizations, including the one
that I work with,